<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Allstate says Otter raising stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Allstate says Otter raising stake.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minerals explorer Allstate Exploration NL said on Friday in a response to an Australian Stock Exchange query that it was aware that is major shareholder Otter Group had been buying more Allstate shares on-market.</p>
<p>Allstate's shares were up A$1.20 at A$4.01 at 10.40 a.m. (2340 GMT).</p>
